  "status_text": "For one family of graphs, a single unchecked statement of ours stands between us and an exact gate count with NOT gates allowed. Checked in Lean, on one-a-side inputs: every fan-in-two AND/OR/NOT circuit for the complement of the N by N matching, row u joined to every column but u, has at least 2N gates, from N = 3 [L-meta-17187]. Whether some such circuit of at most 2N gates exists at every size is on the record as a conjecture [L-meta-20790]; if it is checked, the count is exactly 2N from N = 3.",
